File: contrib/mfs/mfs_file.c
Line: 427
Function: mfs_size
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: No bounds check on fd before indexing fds[fd]; invalid fd can cause out-of-bounds access.

Source context:
